<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barclays target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barclays target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Brown Brothers Harriman &amp; Co analyst Raphael Soifer said he raised the short-term target on Barclays Plc to 1000p from 928p</p>
<p>-- Analyst cites Wednesday's closing price at all-time high, likelihood of further share repurchases, near-term economic trends in U.K., &quot;current round&quot; of earnings estimate increases from London-based analysts</p>
<p>-- Short-term buy rating is maintained</p>
<p>-- Analyst says 1996 earnings estimate is 109.0p, 1997 estimate is 116.0p.</p>
</text>
